    "rich_text_BqhpCE": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_jfyybC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "Clean Beauty Since 1996",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": "text-center mb-6 font-book tracking-wide text-lg"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_7UhUFR": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>Since the beginning, “clean” skincare and body care has been at the heart of everything we do, but what does it mean? For us, it’s simple: We fill our products with the best of what nature provides. Our formulations combine pure potent seaweed, with active botanicals for results you can sea.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_W9xRBM": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Clinical Results. Naturally Clean.",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": "text-center mb-6 font-book tracking-wide text-lg"
          }
        },
        "paragraph_qd7JPU": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>Every ingredient we use is of the highest quality, intentionally chosen for its efficacy, and made with the highest industry standards. \nExplore our full ingredient glossary <a href=\"https://oseamalibu.com/pages/ingredient-glossary?page=1&amp;sort=az&amp;listcount=10\" class=\"underline\">here</a>.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_nmQaEY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Our Formulation Standards",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_kmVL8K": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p class=\"mb-4\">We lead product innovation with nature, science and intuition. We formulate with ingredients that meet our standards:</p>\n<ul class=\"icon-list bullet li:mb-1\">\n<li>Scientifically formulated</li>\n<li>Safe</li>\n<li>Effective</li>\n<li>Gluten-free</li>\n<li>Vegan</li>\n<li>Cruelty-free</li>\n</ul>\n<br><p>Our safety standards are informed by some of the strictest regulations globally. Not only do we screen every ingredient, we maintain an internal database of over 30,000 ingredients that we avoid and regularly update based on the latest research.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_CM8cdR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Proven Efficacy",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_if3mmz": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>We prioritize naturally-derived ingredients, chosen for their safety and efficacy. Our formulas deliver results by using active ingredients at clinically validated levels. We conduct clinical and sensory testing to prove it. </p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_N8TYEH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Power of the Sea",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_EX46E6": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p>The ocean is our deepest inspiration. We formulate with seaweed because it’s a superfood rich in vitamins, minerals and nutrients. The wonders of seaweed are endless. Different species of seaweed can provide a myriad of benefits, including anti-aging and moisturization. Our seaweeds are sourced from around the world, based on scientific data.</p>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_cNxn4w": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Ingredients Matter",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_VQzgfD": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p class=\"mb-4\">We combine our seaweeds with the most renowned skincare actives that have proven efficacy through in-vivo and in-vitro testing. Some of our favorites are:</p>\n<ul class=\"icon-list bullet li:mb-1\">\n<li>Snow Mushroom</li>\n<li>Ceramides</li>\n<li>Lime Pearl</li>\n<li>Squalane</li>\n<li>Vegan Lactic Acid</li>\n<li>Fermented Shiunko Oil</li>\n<li>Hyaluronic Acid</li>\n<li>Niacinamide</li>\n<li>Vitamin C</li>\n<li>Peptides</li>\n<li>Enzymes</li>\n<li>Australian Kakadu Plum</li>\n<li>Kukui Oil</li>\n<li>Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline (DPHP)</li>\n<li>Turmeric</li>\n<li>Bisabolol</li>\n<li>Aloe Vera</li>\n<li>Phytic Acid</li>\n</ul>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_egrQpL": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Our Free Of List",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        },
        "paragraph_nGwqE4": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_text": "<p class=\"mb-4\">We choose to formulate without the following ingredients: </p>\n<ul class=\"icon-list bullet li:mb-1\">\n<li>Animal-derived ingredients</li>\n<li>Benzene/benzene compounds</li>\n<li>Coal tar ingredients</li>\n<li>Formaldehyde/formaldehyde releasers</li>\n<li>Gluten</li>\n<li>Heavy metal compounds</li>\n<li>Hydroquinone</li>\n<li>Nanoparticles</li>\n<li>Polyethylene Glycol compounds (PEGs)</li>\n<li>Parabens</li>\n<li>Phthalates</li>\n<li>Silicone-based compounds/polymers</li>\n<li>Sodium lauryl sulfate (SLS) and sodium laureth sulfate (SLES)</li>\n<li>Synthetic fragrance</li>\n<li>and many more</li>\n</ul>",
            "paragraph_classes": "tracking-wide"
          }
        },
        "heading_YEmRM6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<br>Meet Our Seaweeds",
            "heading_classes": "font-serif text-center text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 max-w-sm mx-auto md:max-w-full",
            "subheading_text": "",
            "subheading_classes": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_jfyybC",
        "paragraph_7UhUFR",
