            "remove_text_wrapper": false,
            "heading": "<h3>Climate Responsible\n</h3>",
            "heading_classes": "mb-1 sm:mb-2 text-lg font-medium tracking-wide",
            "paragraph": "As a brand whose name is inspired by nature's elements, Ocean, Sun, Earth + Atmosphere, we have a distinct duty to protect the elements that we draw from. In 2020, we became one of the first skincare brands to be The Climate Label Certified through The Change Climate Project. This means each year, we measure our cradle-to-customer emissions, implement action plans to reduce them, and invest in high quality, verified carbon credits. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1368/9993/files/OSEA_Climate_Claims_Offset_Disclosure_2025-2026.pdf?v=1772664585\" target=\"_blank\"><u><b>Learn more</b></u></a> about our carbon offset policy.",
